---
// BackgroundTasks, two cases from the captures (relative to the 202):
// C-1: 202 at +4.37, started +4.38, finished +6.39 -> about 2 s later.
// C-2: 202 at +4.41, started +4.42, kill -9 0.5 s later, never finishes.
const W = 900, H = 340;
const X0 = 150, PER_S = 250; // 0..2.5 s
---
<figure class="bep6k">
  <div class="bep6k-scroll">
  <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Two timelines after the client receives 202 Accepted. Case C-1: the task starts right away and finishes two seconds later. Case C-2: the task starts, the server is killed with kill -9 half a second in, and the task never finishes; nothing retries it.">
    {[0, 0.5, 1, 1.5, 2].map((t) => <line x1={X0 + t * PER_S} y1="40" x2={X0 + t * PER_S} y2="250" class="grid" />)}

    <text x="20" y="84" class="code">C-1</text>
    <text x="20" y="104" class="s"><tspan data-lang-en>no crash</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>không crash</tspan></text>
    <polygon points={`${X0},66 ${X0 + 8},74 ${X0},82 ${X0 - 8},74`} class="arrow" />
    <text x={X0 - 8} y="52" class="s">202</text>
    <rect x={X0 + 3} y="62" width={2.01 * PER_S} height="24" rx="4" class="ok" />
    <text x={X0 + 1.0 * PER_S} y="79" text-anchor="middle" class="v"><tspan data-lang-en>report runs</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>báo cáo đang chạy</tspan></text>
    <text x={X0 + 2.01 * PER_S + 12} y="79" class="v"><tspan data-lang-en>finished</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>xong</tspan></text>

    <text x="20" y="174" class="code">C-2</text>
    <text x="20" y="194" class="s"><tspan data-lang-en>kill -9 at 0.5 s</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>kill -9 lúc 0.5 s</tspan></text>
    <polygon points={`${X0},156 ${X0 + 8},164 ${X0},172 ${X0 - 8},164`} class="arrow" />
    <text x={X0 - 8} y="142" class="s">202</text>
    <rect x={X0 + 3} y="152" width={0.5 * PER_S} height="24" rx="4" class="bad" />
    <line x1={X0 + 0.5 * PER_S + 6} y1="144" x2={X0 + 0.5 * PER_S + 6} y2="184" class="lnr" />
    <text x={X0 + 0.5 * PER_S + 18} y="168" class="vr"><tspan data-lang-en>process gone: the work lived only in its memory</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>process mất: việc chỉ nằm trong bộ nhớ của nó</tspan></text>
    <text x={X0 + 0.5 * PER_S + 18} y="200" class="vr"><tspan data-lang-en>nothing ever retries it</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>không gì thử lại nó</tspan></text>

    <line x1={X0} y1="250" x2={X0 + 2.5 * PER_S} y2="250" class="axis" />
    {[0, 0.5, 1, 1.5, 2].map((t) => <text x={X0 + t * PER_S} y="270" text-anchor="middle" class="tk">{t}</text>)}
    <text x={X0 + 2.5 * PER_S + 10} y="270" class="tk"><tspan data-lang-en>seconds after 202</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>giây sau 202</tspan></text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>In both cases the client was already told 202 Accepted. Only one of the two tasks ever finished.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Cả hai trường hợp client đều đã nhận 202 Accepted. Chỉ một trong hai task chạy xong.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .bep6k { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .bep6k-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .bep6k svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 700px; height: auto; }
  .bep6k text { font-size: 13.5px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .bep6k .h { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); font-size: 15px; }
  .bep6k .code { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', ui-monospace, monospace; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); font-size: 14px; }
  .bep6k .s { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 13px; }
  .bep6k .v { fill: var(--text); font-weight: 700; }
  .bep6k .vr { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 700; }
  .bep6k .tk { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 12px; }
  .bep6k .axis { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .bep6k .grid { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; }
  .bep6k .ok { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold-icon); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .bep6k .bad { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .bep6k .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .bep6k .arrow { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .bep6k .arrowr { fill: var(--red); }
  .bep6k .ln { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.6; }
  .bep6k .lnr { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .bep6k figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
